Produce exactly 20 MUTATIONS of this Verilog: single small edits that change behaviour.

Each mutation must be a line of the form:
OLD<TAB>NEW

where OLD is text copied EXACTLY from the file, appearing exactly once, and NEW is the replacement.
Favour: comparison operators flipped, off-by-one on indices and bounds, signed changed to unsigned,
bit ranges shifted by one, a condition inverted, an assignment dropped, a width narrowed.

Output only the 20 lines. No numbering, no commentary.
